 3124   1           * list.  It is safe to access the event list here because it is part of an
 3125   1           * event group implementation - and interrupts don't access event groups
 3126   1           * directly (instead they access them indirectly by pending function calls to
 3127   1           * the task level). */
 3128   1          listINSERT_END( pxEventList, &( pxCurrentTCB->xEventListItem ) );
